# Source scans and working output.
# Scanned volumes run to hundreds of megabytes and are reproducible from the
# original PDF, so neither the input nor anything derived from it belongs here.
# Test fixtures are committed as small PNGs under tests/fixtures/ instead.
*.pdf
work/
out/
debug/
scans/

